      },
      {
        "line": 146,
        "text": "The platform fee is calculated on the total order value and collected when the order is placed. There are certain times when an additional fee might be added to the platform fee to cover processing fees:"
      },
      {
        "line": 147,
        "text": "+1.5% for international (outside of the US) transactions"
      },
      {
        "line": 148,
        "text": "+1.5% for PayPal transactions"
      },
      {
        "line": 149,
        "text": "+0.5% for subscription payments"
      },
      {
        "line": 150,
        "text": "Here’s an example breakdown where someone in France (20% VAT) buys a digital product with a card."
      },
      {
        "line": 151,
        "text": "DescriptionAmount"
      },
      {
        "line": 152,
        "text": "Product price$20.00"
      },
      {
        "line": 153,
        "text": "Tax (20% VAT)$4.00"
      },
      {
        "line": 154,
        "text": "Total$24.00"
      },
      {
        "line": 155,
        "text": "Platform fee ($0.50 + 5% of total + 1.5% int’l payment)$2.06"
      },
      {
        "line": 156,
        "text": "Net profit (total - tax - platform fee)$17.94"
      },
      {
        "line": 159,
        "text": "."
      },
      {
        "line": 160,
        "text": "Payout fees"
      },
      {
        "line": 161,
        "text": "Lemon Squeezy will always try to minimize any fees associated with payouts. However, in some cases we will deduct a small fee from your payout total to cover processing and conversion fees. The actual fee varies depending on your payout method, region and settlement currency."
      },
      {
        "line": 162,
        "text": "Payouts via Stripe"
      },
      {
        "line": 163,
        "text": "Free for bank accounts in the US"
      },
      {
        "line": 164,
        "text": "1% per payout for bank accounts outside the US"
      },
      {
        "line": 165,
        "text": "Payouts via PayPal"
      },
      {
        "line": 166,
        "text": "A flat fee of $0.50 per payout for accounts in the US"
      },
      {
        "line": 167,
        "text": "3% capped at $30 per payout for accounts outside the US"
      },
      {
        "line": 168,
        "text": "Marketing fees"
      },
      {
        "line": 169,
        "text": "Some of Lemon Squeezy’s marketing features have additional fees. These include:"
      },
      {
        "line": 170,
        "text": "+5% for"
      },
      {
        "line": 171,
        "text": "payments recovered through abandoned cart emails"
      },
      {
        "line": 172,
        "text": "+3% for"
      },
      {
        "line": 173,
