      },
      {
        "line": 137,
        "text": "Learn what products are prohibited on Lemon Squeezy."
      },
      {
        "line": 138,
        "text": "Warning"
      },
      {
        "line": 140,
        "text": "terms of service"
      },
      {
        "line": 141,
        "text": "or attempt to sell prohibited products, you risk getting your store placed in review or suspended without notice."
      },
      {
        "line": 142,
        "text": "As a general rule, we allow selling of digital goods that can be fulfilled through Lemon Squeezy’s website."
      },
      {
        "line": 143,
        "text": "Examples of acceptable products"
      },
      {
        "line": 151,
        "text": "Video"
      },
      {
        "line": 152,
        "text": "List of prohibited products"
      },
      {
        "line": 153,
        "text": "The following products and services are prohibited on Lemon Squeezy:"
      },
      {
        "line": 154,
        "text": "Sexually-oriented or pornographic content of any kind, including NSFW chatbots"
      },
      {
        "line": 155,
        "text": "Services of any kind (including marketing, design, web development, consulting or other related services)"
      },
      {
        "line": 156,
        "text": "IPTV services"
      },
      {
        "line": 157,
        "text": "Physical goods of any kind"
      },
      {
        "line": 162,
        "text": "Advertising in newsletters, on websites, or in social media posts"
      },
      {
        "line": 163,
        "text": "Marketplaces - where you use your Lemon Squeezy store to “partner” to sell others’ products"
      },
      {
        "line": 164,
        "text": "Dating sites"
      },
      {
        "line": 170,
        "text": "Regulated products such as: CBD, gambling, weapons, ammunition, pay to play auctions, sweepstakes, lotteries, business-in-a-box, work-from-home, get-rich-quick schemes, etc."
      },
      {
        "line": 171,
        "text": "Regulated services such as: real estate, mortgage, lending, telemarketing, cellular/communication, door-to-door sales, bankruptcy, legal, merchant, debt-relief, collections, banking/financing, currency exchange, warranties, etc."
      },
      {
        "line": 172,
        "text": "Timeshares"
      },
      {
        "line": 176,
        "text": "NFT & Crypto related products. The entire crypto market is extremely volatile and Lemon Squeezy is not designed to support these types of products"
      },
      {
        "line": 177,
        "text": "If you are unsure whether your content is prohibited, please contact"
